1></header></div></div><div class=3D"wrapper"><article><section class=3D"tl=
dr">Learn how to set up and use 1Password Developer in the desktop apps to =
help manage your developer tools and credentials.</section><p>1Password Dev=
eloper is a collection of features that allows you to discover and set up d=
eveloper tools. You can view and create SSH keys and bookmarks, manage vari=
ables in your environments, check your local disk for vulnerable credential=
s, and more, from within the 1Password desktop app.</p><p>Before you can us=
e 1Password Developer, you=E2=80=99ll need to <a href=3D"https://support.1p=
assword.com/developer/1password.com/pricing/password-manager">sign up for a=
 1Password account</a>, then download and set up 1Password for <a href=3D"h=
ttps://1password.com/downloads/mac">Mac</a>, <a href=3D"https://1password.c=
om/downloads/windows">Windows</a>, or <a href=3D"https://1password.com/down=
loads/linux">Linux</a>.</p><p><img class=3D"center" src=3D"https://i.1passw=
ord.com/media/developer/developer-overview-screen.png" alt=3D"The 1Password=
 Developer overview screen in the 1Password desktop app with sections for S=
SH Agent, Environments, CLI, and Developer Watchtower." width=3D"90%"></p><=
nav class=3D"toc secondary-nav"><ul><li><a href=3D"https://support.1passwor=
d.com/developer/#turn-on-1password-developer"><i class=3D"fa fa-toggle-on">=
</i>
Turn on 1Password Developer</a></li><li><a href=3D"https://support.1passwor=
d.com/developer/#1password-ssh-agent"><i class=3D"fa fa-key"></i>
1Password SSH Agent</a></li><li><a href=3D"https://support.1password.com/de=
veloper/#1password-environments"><i class=3D"fa fa-cube"></i>
1Password Environments</a></li><li><a href=3D"https://support.1password.com=
