your SSH keys in 1Password</a></li><li><a href=3D"https://support.1password=
.com/watchtower-privacy/">About Watchtower privacy in 1Password</a></li></u=
l><p></p></div><h2 id=3D"data-retention-and-privacy">Data retention and pri=
